<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109835" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφέρπω</span></b> , (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>creep on
				secretly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφεῖρπε γὰρ πολύ</span> the report
				<i>spread</i> far, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				786
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθονερὸν ὑπ᾽ ἄλγος ἕρπει
				Ἀτρείδαις</span> angry feelings <i>creep abroad</i>
			against them, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				450
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c.
			acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. εὐνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. σκοπόν</span>”
				<i>secretly aim at,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρχομαι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, of involuntary feelings, <i>steal upon, come over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρά μ᾽ ὑφέρπει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					270
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόμος μ᾽ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					463
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
